# This file only exists so the /app/extra-libs directory is present in the image.
#
# Drop extra jars here (via a COPY in a downstream Dockerfile layer) to add them to the
# application classpath — e.g. a Kafka SASL/OAuth login handler or a custom RecordMapper.
# The directory is already on the classpath (see the jib `extraClasspath` config in
# build.gradle.kts), so no need to edit /app/jib-classpath-file.
